Third-party material
--------------------

The MIT licence above covers this adapter's own code. It does not cover material
that belongs to Roborock and is only reproduced here so the adapter can show the
same things their app shows:

  * src-tab/src/map3d/roborockModels.json
    3D furniture models, extracted from assets/models_g3db/ of the Roborock app
    and converted by scripts/convert_g3db_models.js. The geometry is Roborock's.

  * The furniture and dock icons drawn on the map. These are not shipped at all:
    they are read at runtime from the control plugin the user's own Roborock
    account downloads, so an installation that never signs in simply has none of
    them.

Roborock holds the rights to both. They are used here to render a user's own
device, they are not part of this project's licensed work, and they must not be
redistributed as if they were.
